# <type>(<optional scope>): <short imperative summary>
#
# Types: feat, fix, docs, refactor, test, build, ci, chore, perf, style
# Scope examples: api, config-flow, coordinator, sensor, card, frontend, docs
#
# Keep the subject concise (50 characters preferred; 72 maximum). Do not end it
# with a period. Use the imperative mood: "add", not "added" or "adds".
#
# Explain what changed and why. Wrap body lines at 72 characters. Omit this
# section for small, self-explanatory changes.
#
# BREAKING CHANGE: <describe any required user migration>
# Fixes #<issue-number>
#
# Examples:
# feat(card): add next collection summary
# fix(api): handle councils without green waste
# docs: explain dashboard resource setup
